efad92cdf8556889bca0b6282"}, "language": "english", "review": "I think for someone who wasn't into the Sniper Elite franchise, is this a good way to get into it. I'm playing it with bf and we are surprised how much we love it. We definitely will buy the DLCs and other games asap. \r\n10/10", "timestamp_created": 1761822627, "timestamp_updated": 1761822627, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 3, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.527662336826324463", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207914731", "author": {"steamid": "76561199270185260", "personaname": "Skuller", "persona_status": "in-game", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199270185260/", "num_games_owned": 254, "num_reviews": 50, "playtime_forever": 2412, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2106, "last_played": 1762608000, "avatar": "3d5bcd5dfb31ebf868a6be680283385be86e5fac"}, "language": "english", "review": "yes", "timestamp_created": 1761778861, "timestamp_updated": 1761778861, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207911476", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056458749", "personaname": "Waffle", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198056458749/", "num_games_owned": 441, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 1067, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 704, "last_played": 1784409570, "avatar": "de7aed4299406a52b01b0fc087ec5eb1d380b7e7"}, "language": "english", "review": "I'd give it a low 4, more than anything. Good game by all means but lacked a lot of the meat the mainline games had. Missions felt too small, and I encountered a lot less enemies than I was expecting. Of course, as it's not a mainstream game I can understand it being smaller but I would see it as a large DLC instead of a standalone. \r\n\r\nWhat caused a lower score? \r\n1. Enemy count. Some parts of the levels felt empty. I was in Nazi strongholds and right up in their ♥♥♥♥, I expected to find a lot more guarding and patrols, not waltz through the front door\r\n2. Mission length. The missions felt too short compared to the mainline series. Even some of the DLC missions in 4 took longer than a mission here\r\n3. Level design. Not the levels exactly; always well done! However, missing planes on buildings in the backgrounds, or models either floating or a light two feet from the wall instead of being *on* the wall. Some little snags really in the texturing that didn't need to be there. \r\n\r\nOf course, no game is perfect, but it was a fun one to waste some evenings after work on. \r\n\r\nWhat I enjoyed?\r\n1. The campaign! It was nice to have a more condensed story (ironic given I said the levels were short), and it felt good to experience. \r\n2. The ammo types. Need I say more about the explosive rounds? An explosive round to the nuts is cathartic to watch.\r\n3. Shooting Nazi's because it's one of life's pleasures.", "timestamp_created": 1761775802, "timestamp_updated": 1761775802, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207911198", "author": {"steamid": "76561198782758127", "personaname": "Head_Hunter", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198782758127/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 8663, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3431, "last_played": 1785596736, "avatar": "25aaaee11329c4fa17aacf867d9397f6478acf97"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love this game for stealth and strategy lover.", "timestamp_created": 1761775520, "timestamp_updated": 1761775520, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "207906831", "author": {"steamid": "76561198950107464", "personaname": "virtualbri", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198950107464/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 28, "playtime_forever": 4267, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 254, "last_played": 1778373618, "avatar": "de0fcf8fae8c82fba0393047c3c2710bd74eae61"}, "language": "english", "review": "Really DLC for Sniper Elite 5.  \n\nNo real game changes.  \n\nDon't pay full price for it\n\nThat said, always fun to kill Nazis.", "timestamp_created": 1761771818, "timestamp_updated": 1761771818, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 38, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.789441764354705811", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1738246187", "reactions": [{"reaction_type": 19, "count": 2}, {"reaction_type": 6, "count": 1}]}]}